<title>USA: Easy Access, Strategic Telecom to merge.</title>
<headline>Easy Access, Strategic Telecom to merge.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Easy Access International Inc said Wednesday it signed a letter of intent to merge with Strategic Telecom Systems Inc, a privately held telecommunications marketing company.</p>
<p>The company said the merger would result in combined unaudited annual revenues of more than $100 million.</p>
<p>Easy Access said Noble International Investments, a privately-held company, is its investment banking company and financial advisor for the deal.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
